*.jsonl

# Test fixtures. Tests inject isolated managers pointed at data/test_*.json
# so they never touch the real data files; those artifacts are recreated by
# every run and must never be committed. Without this they show up as
# untracked noise in `git status` after each suite run and eventually get
# swept into a commit by a stray `git add -A`.
data/test_*.json
